<title>USA: OMAHA HOGS $2.00 LOWER - USDA.</title>
<headline>OMAHA HOGS $2.00 LOWER - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>OMAHA 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barrows and gilts were $2.00 lower.</p>
<p>Top $56.00 per cwt. - USDA</p>
<p>US 1-3    220-260 lbs	    56.00</p>
<p>US 2-3    260-280 lbs    55.00-55.50</p>
<p>Sows: 20 percent.  Weak to 1.00 lower. Top 50.00.</p>
<p>US   1-3  350-500 lbs   opened 46.00</p>
<p>US   2-3  500-650 lbs    49.50-50.00</p>
